===Etymology 2===
{{etyl|LL.|en}} {{lena}} {{m|la|amma}}, probably of interjectional or imitative origin: compare {{etyl|es|-}} {{m|es|ama}}, German {{m|de|Amme}}, nurse, Basque {{m|eu|ama}} mother, {{etyl|he|en}}, {{etyl|ar|en}}.

